1134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1007 0 R
/E (The report's findings are dependent on the quality, coverage, and methodology of the external datasets on which it is based. Differences in source definitions, reporting periods, country coverage, and update schedules can affect comparability. The use of 2026 data where available, and 2025 data where 2026 figures had not yet been reported also means that not every indicator represents the same reference year.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
1135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1007 0 R
/E (To improve consistency, the data were standardised before being incorporated into the F\(in\)AR scoring system, and the same scoring approach was applied across the countries covered by the report. Nevertheless, the resulting scores should be understood as index-based comparative measures, not precise measurements of freedom or wellbeing.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
