1487 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1017 0 R
/E (Starting a business became easier in some African economies in 2026, but the improvements were far from widespread. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1488 0 obj
<<
