/Pg 33 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
1928 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1027 0 R
/E (Progress in income and monetary conditions provided positive movement for Africa on the prosperity index, while improvements in parts of the education, infrastructure and healthcare landscape offered further signs of opportunity.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
