/P 1035 0 R
/E (To fix these differences in the region, SADC leaders signed a major agreement in August 2026 to create a single regional visa called the SADC UNIVISA. A pilot program is currently being set up between Angola, Mozambique, Namibia, South Africa, and Zimbabwe so travelers can move between these five countries much more easily)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [11]
>>
