/E (Recently, the region's overall travel score dropped because more than 180 travel routes added new visa requirements. Only 34% of these countries allow each other's citizens to visit completely visa-free without any paperwork. Meanwhile, the number of routes that require a visa before you fly rose from 18% to 25%.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
2440 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1035 0 R
/E (To help open up the region, Togo recently dropped all visa requirements for African travelers, and Chad announced it will do the same starting January 1, 2027. These changes are expected to make travel across this part of Africa much easier soon.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
2441 0 obj
<<
