/P 1035 0 R
/E (ECCAS remains one of Africa's least open regions, with an AVOI score of 0.327 in 2025. Most member states remain among the lower-ranked countries, although Burundi and Rwanda perform better.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [15]
>>
