/E (Even with these positive changes, traveling within this region can still be tough. Only 21% of travel routes in IGAD countries allow citizens to visit each other completely visa-free. To fix this, the region created a "Free Movement Protocol" back in 2021 to allow easier border crossings. So far, five member countries have signed it, but it cannot start until governments formally pass it into law.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [31]
