<<
/Title (This chart highlights the breakdown of entry rules across all cross-border travel routes on the continent. The data shows a positive shift toward easier access, with a combined 53% of travel paths no longer requiring a strict prior visa. This progress is driven by a steady climb in Visas on Arrival \(25%\) and Visa-Free travel \(28%\), which has successfully pushed pre-departure visa restrictions down to 47% continent-wide.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5518 0 R
/Next 6609 0 R
>>
endobj
6331 0 obj
<<
/Title (89.8% of monitored African countries \(44 out of 49\) fall into the Obstructed, Repressed, or Closed categories. This means the vast majority of people on the continent live in environments with heavily restricted civic freedoms.)
/Dest [43 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5518 0 R
/Prev 6610 0 R
>>
