/Title (Togo recorded the strongest performance. Ethiopia and Burkina Faso also made notable progress, while Ghana, Senegal, Uganda and Egypt strengthened their positions. These gains suggest that digital infrastructure, is becoming an increasingly important driver of growth in several African economies.)
