/Title (Countries with internet shutdowns in Africa in 2025: Angola, Cameroon, Central African Republic, Chad, Democratic Republic of the Congo, Equatorial Guinea, Ethiopia, Guinea, Guinea-Bissau, Kenya, Nigeria, South Sudan, Tanzania, Togo, and Uganda. A total of 15 countries \(27.8%\) experienced shutdowns, while 39 countries \(72.2%\) did not.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5518 0 R
/Prev 6923 0 R
/Next 6902 0 R
>>
