6914 0 obj
<<
/Title (Digital economic growth shows how effectively countries are using technology, connectivity and digital services to create new economic opportunities. Beyond internet access itself, a stronger digital economy can support entrepreneurship, improve productivity, expand financial inclusion, access to services and create new opportunities for businesses and workers.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6859 0 R
/Prev 6904 0 R
/Next 6915 0 R
>>
