/Title (This chart illustrates the massive visa-openness gap between Africa's regional blocs. ECOWAS \(59.7\) and the EAC \(53.8\) lead the continent as the most integrated and open regions. Conversely, Central Africa's ECCAS \(32.7\) and North Africa's AMU \(16.6\) remain heavily restrictive. This data reveals that true continental mobility is highly unequal, split between open eastern/western blocs and insulated central/northern blocs.)
/Dest [41 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5518 0 R
/Prev 6939 0 R
/Next 6923 0 R
>>
endobj
