/Title (Moving between these neighboring countries is highly restricted. Previously, 70% of travel routes within the group were visa-free, but that has now dropped to 60%. While Algeria and Tunisia are still fairly welcoming to other AMU citizens, new rules in Algeria, Morocco, and Mauritania have made traveling much tougher. Libya remains the most strict, requiring a traditional visa from almost every African country.)
/Dest [41 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 5518 0 R
/Prev 6938 0 R
/Next 6951 0 R
>>
